                <pb facs="0208" n="90" sameAs="frus:frus1929v03/pg90"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.51 Public Works/22: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-02-14T11:00:00+02:00">February 14, 1929—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 14—9:05 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>16. At an early hour this morning the Chamber voted ratification of Seligman loan
                    contract which now awaits only favorable action of International Financial
                    Commission in order to become operative.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Skinner</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
